    },
    "body": "**Problem:** The Silent Payments ctime test scans without a label callback and uses a scan key that no longer matches its generated output.\r\nIt therefore covers neither a successful scan nor the label-candidate batch path while the scan key is marked undefined.\r\n\r\n**Fix:** Create the scan pubkey from the key used for scanning so the generated output matches, place a nonmatching output before it, and scan with a callback that checks each serialized candidate is defined and counts misses.\r\nThe test now covers a pending label batch flushed before a direct match and a final no-match batch.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nDraft to get conceptual review first to make sure I understood the problem correctly.",
